# Hoenn & Seek (part 14): teams that replace Emerald's in src/data/trainers_hoenn.party.
# Read by tools/hoenn/gen_hoenn_ids.py. Lines before a block's first blank line replace
# those header keys; the rest replaces the Pokemon. Gym levels are placeholders:
# src/hoenn_scaling.c moves the strongest to the stamp curve and keeps the gaps.
# No Mega Stones anywhere (no Megas in Hoenn & Seek). Elite Four (Lv 76-81) and
# Wallace (Lv 80-84) have fixed levels. 2.0 part 16: TRAINER_LEROY (Emerald's unused
# slot) is DAMIAN (RYDER until 17r), Charmander's old trainer outside the Cerulean Gym;
# src/hoenn_scaling.c sets his ace to your progress level cap (gaps kept: Arcanine is the ace).
# 2.1-10: the 15 elite trainers (role "elite" in trainer_curation.json, at the end of this
# file) have curated teams of 6 with held items and Smart AI; levels are placeholders: the
# ace is the next Hoenn leader's ace - 1 (HOENN_LADDER_ELITE), gaps kept.
# 2.1-12: TRAINER_KAYLEE (Emerald's unused slot) is EXPLORER BRIDGETTE, the first friend trainer
# (src/hoenn_friends.c); her levels are placeholders for the top-90 ladder (Garchomp is the ace).
# 2.1-14: TRAINER_DUDLEY is SKYDIVER AIDAN (Salamence is the ace), TRAINER_TERRY is ATHLETE BROCK
# (Machamp is the ace). HARD battles put every Pokémon at Lv 100 instead.

